<title>USA: Cyprus Amax Q4 hurt by lower realizations.</title>
<headline>Cyprus Amax Q4 hurt by lower realizations.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER, Colo. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus Amax Minerals Co said its fourth quarter and full year 1996 results were hurt, in part, by lower copper, molybdenum and coal realizations.</p>
<p>Cyprus Amax posted fourth quarter operating earnings of $0.19 a share, compared to $0.93 a share last year. On a net basis, the company lost $0.61 a share in the fourth quarter, compared to a profit of $0.93 a share last year.</p>
<p>During the fourth quarter, Cyprus Amax said it achieved commercial production at its El Abra copper mine in Chile.</p>
